The proof driver does not automatically reuse a separately discharged claim as a rewrite lemma in this invocation mode, so it was re-executing the helper inside the circular proof. I’m making the composition explicit with staged definitions: prove the helper in the base semantics, import that proved summary to prove the loop, then import both proved summaries to prove the entry point.
